flowchart LR
  accTitle: Deployment Checklist
  accDescr {
    This checklist explains how to safely deploy NutsNews across the web app, Worker shards, controller Worker, Cloudflare cache, and post-deploy verification.
  }
  PR["Change in source repo"] --> RC["Review candidate and run tests"]
  RC -->|Green| MERGE["Merge to main"]
  MERGE --> BUILD["Release build + image publish"]
  BUILD --> STAGING["VPS staging apply + qualification"]
  STAGING --> PRODUCTION["Web/Worker production rollout"]
  PRODUCTION --> PURGE["Targeted Cloudflare cache controls"]
  PURGE --> VERIFY["Post-deploy smoke + observability checks"]
  VERIFY --> END["Issue closed or rollback prepared"]
